{"slug":"do-not-define-any-variables-to-swap-adjacent-elements-of-the-array","title":"不定义任何变量交互数组中相邻元素","date":"2019-07-07","tags":["Javascript"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"不定义任何变量交互数组中相邻元素","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>不定义任何变量交互数组中相邻元素</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"要点\">要点</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用<code>slice</code>方法将需要交换的元素作为数组取出</li>\n<li>使用<code>reverse</code>方法将元素交换位置</li>\n<li>使用<code>...</code>操作符将交换后的数组展开</li>\n<li>将展开结果作为<code>splice</code>方法的后两个参数，从而取代原来的两个元素</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码\">代码</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">/**</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> * [exchangeAdjacentElements 交互数组中相邻元素]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">@</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">param</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97\">  {</span><span style=\"color:#2E8F82;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">[type]</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#5F7E97\">}</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#78CCF0;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> arr</span><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> [目标数组]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-light-fon